-- P3 identity schema (TARGET_ARCHITECTURE §3, ADR-14). Tables only; the SECURITY DEFINER functions through
-- which the app reaches them follow in later migrations.
--
-- ADR-14 D4: alphakolect_app and alphakolect_readonly get NO privileges on identity.* or
-- util.rate_limit_counters (default-deny, P1). Tokens are stored only as SHA-256 hex hashes and passwords only
-- as argon2id PHC strings — enforced below by CHECK constraints.
-- The table DDL is generated by `prisma migrate diff` and reviewed; the invariants section is hand-written.

